  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantChangesInOperationsDuringTheYearTextBlock id="Tag700" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;4. Effective October 1, 2025, Andeavor&amp;#160;Gathering I, LLC transferred all jurisdictional assets and canceled its FERC tariff, and subsequently ceased to be subject to the jurisdiction of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission. The entity was later sold and its legal name changed to Harvest Rockies Gathering LLC&amp;#160;prior to December 31, 2025.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantChangesInOperationsDuringTheYearTextBlock>
